 "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300619_1114273710776542_3030927948218244974_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9wqosQnWhE8Q7kNvwEn96Wb&_nc_oc=AdrUJ7Y6zev9qVz-HVr6p9XT-x7-9EStuoXm9_xCagF4j4lJ8HrrWEtyLHAgDsePJ5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTqCTerf4GSGpH5N4ah6wKJqIISgCHAWYTWI9pZaF8upA&oe=6B01CB42"}, {"file_name": "GC5.png", "id": "708016741692569", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303386_708016745025902_295013115879377012_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k68BPf1jA20Q7kNvwHsozsh&_nc_oc=AdpiV0Kp0D4PN3ca9036LrQB6AGd9J_TRYqQoSdq6FDoZiNt-alm2DVhDMpwB2lMmdk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQFMB6M1B-4F_IRc9lv9O8b0NUehIXku6MJCT0eyMAagg&oe=6B01D1F5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Goalie Challenge", "keywords": ["sports", "hockey", "goalie", "training"], "long_description": "Step into the crease and feel the rush! Goalie Challenge VR puts you right in the net where lightning-fast reflexes and nerves of steel decide your fate. Built by a real goalie for real goalies (and anyone who loves hockey), this free experience delivers the thrill of the rink \u2014 without the ice time.\n\t\u2022\tImmersive Gameplay \u2013 Feel every shot with surround sound, haptic vibration, and realistic puck physics.\n\t\u2022\tSkill Progression \u2013 Tackle multiple difficulty levels and sharpen your reflexes as the shots get faster and smarter.\n\t\u2022\tPlay Anywhere \u2013 Perfect for players far from the rink or those who just can\u2019t get enough of the action.\n\nCatch. Block. Dominate the crease.\nThe ultimate hockey goalie simulator \u2014 now on Meta Quest.", "short_description": "Stop slapshots in this fast-paced, fully immersive VR goalie challenge!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/doc